-- NEGATIVE fixture for D-SVCEMPTY (spec §15.12's companion note).
--
-- Two sections, one per message form:
--
--   * `pinned scenarios` holds ONLY rule-date-rebinding decides. R12 drops
--     them all, so the § has no emitted members and no <decisionService> —
--     D-SVCEMPTY arm (i) says so (before the note, the § simply vanished).
--   * `fees` keeps its one decide, but a singleton § has no encapsulated
--     member and no input decision, so it cannot satisfy DMN 1.3 §6.3.10's
--     decisionService shape — D-SVCEMPTY arm (ii), the previously silent
--     probe-D5 skip, made loud.
--
-- Neither § may draw D-FLAVOR-NOSERVICE: that note is gated on the service
-- actually emitting (a note naming an element id the artifact does not
-- contain would be describing a different file).
--
-- NEVER added to `goldenSubjects`. Asserted from jl4/tests/DmnExport.hs.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

§ `fees`

TIMEZONE IS "Asia/Singapore"

GIVETH A NUMBER
`the fee` MEANS
    IF `RULES EFFECTIVE DATE` AT LEAST Date 1 1 2024 THEN 9 ELSE 3

§§ `pinned scenarios`

GIVETH A NUMBER
`the fee under the 2016 rules` MEANS
    `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (Date 1 9 2016) `the fee`

GIVETH A NUMBER
`the fee under the 2019 rules` MEANS
    `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (Date 1 6 2019) `the fee`
